Plinius: "Desktop over VNC" as a panel of its own below Printers.

A panel in the sidebar after Printers with the switch for the desktop over VNC, the status, the
address and the allowed networks. The panel (cc-desktop-vnc-panel.*) and its desktop file come as
separate files; it is only listed when plinius-desktop is installed.

diff --git a/panels/desktop-vnc/meson.build b/panels/desktop-vnc/meson.build
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..cd4bd1571
--- /dev/null
+++ b/panels/desktop-vnc/meson.build
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Plinius: Desktop over VNC panel. The sources and the desktop file (with its
+# translations) come as separate files of gnome-control-center-plinius.
+panels_list += cappletname
+
+install_data(
+  'gnome-desktop-vnc-panel.desktop',
+  install_dir: control_center_desktopdir,
+)
+
+sources = files(
+  'cc-desktop-vnc-panel.c',
+)
+
+panels_libs += static_library(
+  cappletname,
+  sources: sources,
+  include_directories: [ top_inc, common_inc ],
+  dependencies: common_deps,
+  c_args: cflags,
+)
